msgid "显式 I2C 总线恢复"
msgstr "Explicit I2C bus recovery"

msgid ""
"`nx_i2c_bus_clear_t` 是调用方持有的可选 GPIO 恢复机制。它不扫描设备，不重放 失败的 transaction，也不自动替换 "
"SoC 的 `nx_i2c_port_recover`。既有 controller "
"恢复与本机制分开：前者证明控制器停止并回收硬件引用；后者需要板卡明确授权， 才允许切换双引脚并驱动实际电气总线。"
msgstr ""
"`nx_i2c_bus_clear_t` is an optional caller-owned GPIO recovery mechanism. It"
" neither scans devices nor replays failed transactions, and does not "
"automatically replace the SoC's `nx_i2c_port_recover`. Existing controller "
"recovery is separate: it proves controller stop and removes hardware "
"references; this mechanism needs explicit board authorization before "
"switching both pins and driving the electrical bus."

msgid ""
"公共接口在 `io/include/nexus/io/i2c_bus_clear.h`，算法在 "
"`io/src/i2c_bus_clear.c`。生产代码仍为 C11，没有 heap、默认 worker、动态注册表 或隐藏 OS 锁。调用方保存 "
"session、只读 ops 表、adapter context 和 clock，按 单 executor 合同调用；这些对象必须活到租约成功归还。"
msgstr ""
"The public interface is `io/include/nexus/io/i2c_bus_clear.h`, and the "
"algorithm is `io/src/i2c_bus_clear.c`. Production remains C11, with no heap,"
" default worker, dynamic registry or hidden OS lock. The caller retains the "
"session, read-only operations table, adapter context and clock, and follows "
"the single-executor contract; these objects must remain alive until the "
"lease is successfully returned."

msgid "板级授权与资源交接"
msgstr "Board authorization and resource handoff"

msgid ""
"调用方显式提供 `acquire/drive/sample/wait_until/release` 五个方法和 "
"`nx_clock_t`。`acquire` 的成功合同包括：controller 已停用，DMA 与 IRQ 发布者 已排空，其他总线 master "
"与引脚用户静止，SCL/SDA 独占，双引脚已安全释放并 采用开漏模式。失败不能留下引用、租约或未报告硬件效果。"
msgstr ""
"The caller explicitly supplies five methods, "
"`acquire/drive/sample/wait_until/release`, and an `nx_clock_t`. Successful "
"`acquire` means the controller is disabled, DMA and IRQ publishers are "
"drained, other bus masters and pin users are quiescent, SCL/SDA are "
"exclusively owned, and both pins are safely released in open-drain mode. "
"Failure must retain no references or leases and leave no unreported hardware"
" effects."

msgid ""
"`drive(scl_low, sda_low)` 中 `true` 只允许拉低，`false` 只允许释放为高阻。 公共 "
"`nx_gpio_port_write` 不能证明开漏、电压、上拉或引脚复用，因此不能直接 替代这个授权合同。`sample` "
"必须读取实际输入电平。adapter 必须先核对 PCB 修订、两引脚权限、上拉、电压与所有权交接，不能从芯片 capability 猜测接线。 "
"这批交付没有自动接入 F407/F470 物理引脚，也没有对未审板卡进行操作。"
msgstr ""
"For `drive(scl_low, sda_low)`, `true` permits only driving low and `false` "
"permits only high-impedance release. Public `nx_gpio_port_write` does not "
"prove open-drain mode, voltage, pull-ups or pin multiplexing and cannot "
"directly replace this authorization contract. `sample` must read actual "
"input levels. The adapter must review PCB revision, both pin permissions, "
"pull-ups, voltage and ownership handoff first; chip capabilities do not "
"establish wiring. This delivery does not automatically bind F407/F470 "
"physical pins or operate unreviewed boards."

msgid ""
"当 `scl_low=true`，adapter 必须先建立 SCL LOW，再修改 SDA。两引脚可能在 不同 GPIO "
"port，不能假设双引脚寄存器写原子；尤其从失败保留状态重试 STOP 时，SDA 的先前输出状态可能未知。"
msgstr ""
"When `scl_low=true`, the adapter must establish SCL LOW before changing SDA."
" The pins may belong to different GPIO ports, so atomic dual-pin register "
"writes cannot be assumed; particularly when retrying STOP from retained "
"failure state, SDA's previous output state may be unknown."

msgid ""
"`release` 恢复已保存的 peripheral/pin 所有权。返回失败必须保留租约与保存的 状态；调用方不能把 controller "
"再次启用或复用 context。所有方法都是有界的， `acquire/release/drive/sample` 不等待其他 owner；只有显式 "
"`wait_until` 按绝对 时间等待。wait adapter 必须证明有限返回界，即使 clock 停止也必须能报错并 返回，不能在 "
"callback 内无限等待冻结的 timer；helper 不能抢占或修复一个 违反这个合同的 callback。helper 返回后重读 "
"clock，晚到则报 deadline 失败。 调用方不能在 callback 内递归调用本 session。"
msgstr ""
"`release` restores saved peripheral/pin ownership. Failure must retain the "
"lease and saved state; the caller cannot re-enable the controller or reuse "
"the context. All methods are bounded; `acquire/release/drive/sample` do not "
"wait for another owner. Only explicit `wait_until` waits against absolute "
"time. The wait adapter must prove a finite return bound and report failure "
"even if the clock stops; it cannot wait forever inside a callback on a "
"frozen timer. The helper cannot preempt or repair a callback violating this "
"contract. It rereads the clock after callback return and reports deadline "
"failure if late. The caller must not recursively call this session from a "
"callback."

msgid "执行与停止"
msgstr "Execution and stop"

msgid ""
"调用方显式选择非零 `low_us/high_us/stop_setup_us/stretch_poll_us`，依据实际 "
"器件和电气模式给出时间。没有默认“安全”数值。`run` 接收同一 monotonic clock 域的有限 primary deadline 和独立 "
"cleanup deadline，后者不早于前者。 `NX_DEADLINE_NEVER`、无效 timing 与缺失方法均在硬件访问前拒绝。"
msgstr ""
"The caller explicitly selects nonzero "
"`low_us/high_us/stop_setup_us/stretch_poll_us` from actual device and "
"electrical-mode requirements. There are no default ‘safe’ values. `run` "
"takes a finite primary deadline and independent cleanup deadline in the same"
" monotonic clock domain; cleanup must not precede primary. "
"`NX_DEADLINE_NEVER`, invalid timing and missing methods are rejected before "
"hardware access."

msgid ""
"取得租约后，机制先观察实际 SCL/SDA。SCL 被拉低时，以有界 poll interval 等待 clock stretching；每次 "
"`wait_until` 返回成功后重读 clock，证明它已推进至 target。冻结、倒退或耗尽的 clock 报 IO 并退出。释放 SCL "
"后，只有观察到实际 HIGH 才开始计算高电平保持时间。SDA 已释放时不生成恢复脉冲；否则最多九个 完整低/高周期，SDA "
"释放后立即结束，不再继续脉冲。"
msgstr ""
"After acquiring the lease, the mechanism observes actual SCL/SDA. If SCL is "
"held low, it waits for clock stretching with a bounded poll interval. Every "
"successful `wait_until` is followed by a clock reread to prove progress to "
"the target. A frozen, backward or exhausted clock reports IO and exits. High"
" hold time starts only after actual HIGH is observed following SCL release. "
"If SDA is already released, no recovery pulses are generated; otherwise at "
"most nine complete low/high cycles occur, stopping immediately once SDA "
"releases."

msgid ""
"拉低阶段结束后还会 sample 确认实际 SCL LOW；释放后的高周期结束也确认 SCL 仍 HIGH。STOP 先验证双线 LOW，并在 "
"setup 结束后再次确认 SCL HIGH、SDA LOW， 才释放 SDA。间隔中未经采集的瞬态无法用主机模型证明，仍需真实波形验收。"
msgstr ""
"At the end of the low phase, sampling also confirms actual SCL LOW; at the "
"end of a released high cycle, it confirms SCL remains HIGH. STOP first "
"verifies both lines LOW, and after setup again verifies SCL HIGH and SDA LOW"
" before releasing SDA. Host models cannot prove unsampled transients between"
" observations; real waveform acceptance remains required."

msgid ""
"任何取得租约的执行都在 cleanup budget 内尝试 STOP：先拉低 SCL，再在 SCL 低时拉低 SDA；保持 low，释放 "
"SCL，等到实际 HIGH；保持 STOP setup 时间， 释放 SDA，再保持 high 并观察双线 HIGH。STOP "
"准备边沿不计入最多九个恢复 脉冲，未完成的高周期也不计为已完成。STOP 失败不会被误报为 bus free。"
msgstr ""
"Every execution that acquired a lease attempts STOP within the cleanup "
"budget: drive SCL low, drive SDA low while SCL is low, hold low, release SCL"
" and wait for actual HIGH, hold STOP setup time, release SDA, then hold high"
" and observe both lines HIGH. STOP preparation edges do not count toward the"
" nine recovery pulses, and an incomplete high cycle is not counted as "
"completed. Failed STOP is never reported as bus free."

msgid ""
"STOP 与恢复状态不是 transaction 完成状态。即使总线恢复成功，原失败数据 操作仍失败，是否发起新 transaction "
"是外部产品策略。"
msgstr ""
"STOP and recovery state are not transaction completion. Even successful bus "
"recovery leaves the original failed data operation failed; starting a new "
"transaction is external product policy."

msgid "独立错误与保留状态"
msgstr "Separate errors and retained state"

msgid ""
"输出包含 `primary/cleanup/pulses/stop_observed/lease_held`。`run` 返回 primary "
"失败，否则返回 cleanup；cleanup 永远不覆盖主错误。未取得租约时不会调用 release。取得租约后 STOP 失败或 release "
"方法失败，均保留 session 和完整 租约，停止新 transaction 与 recovery pulse。"
msgstr ""
"Outputs include `primary/cleanup/pulses/stop_observed/lease_held`. `run` "
"returns the primary failure if present, otherwise cleanup; cleanup never "
"overwrites the primary error. Without an acquired lease, release is not "
"called. After acquisition, failed STOP or a failed release method retains "
"the session and full lease and stops new transactions and recovery pulses."

msgid ""
"`finish` 仅重试未证明的 STOP 或所有权归还，不重新 acquire、不生成恢复 脉冲。如果 STOP 已证明而 release "
"失败，下一次只重试 release；已成功步骤 不重复。`finish` 返回最新 cleanup，输出中的原 primary 与 pulse "
"count 不变。 新的 `run` 和重新 init 在仍有租约时拒绝，不用“重初始化”掩盖残余状态。"
msgstr ""
"`finish` retries only unproven STOP or ownership return; it neither "
"reacquires nor generates recovery pulses. If STOP is proven but release "
"failed, the next call retries release only; successful steps are not "
"repeated. `finish` returns the latest cleanup, preserving the original "
"primary and pulse count in outputs. A new `run` or reinitialization is "
"rejected while a lease remains; reinitialization cannot conceal residual "
"state."

msgid ""
"如果 release 方法实际成功，但返还时间已经超出 deadline，cleanup 报 TIMEOUT， 同时 "
"`lease_held=false` 如实报告已归还的资源。deadline 错误不能虚造租约。 其他保留的失败不能释放、丢弃或移走 "
"session/context；产品必须隔离故障设备， 由明确 recovery/reset 策略处理。机制不自动复位或自称安全输出。"
msgstr ""
"If the release method actually succeeds but returns after the deadline, "
"cleanup reports TIMEOUT while `lease_held=false` truthfully records returned"
" resources. A deadline error cannot invent a lease. Other retained failures "
"prohibit releasing, discarding or moving session/context; the product must "
"isolate the faulty device and follow explicit recovery/reset policy. The "
"mechanism neither resets automatically nor claims safe outputs."

msgid "验证边界"
msgstr "Verification boundary"

msgid ""
"GoogleTest/GoogleMock 用真实生产算法及外部引脚/clock/lease mock 验证九周期 上限、SCL "
"stretching、冻结 clock、primary/cleanup、STOP 失败保留、仅清理 "
"重试与实例独立性。这证明软件合同，不证明实际开漏或波形。"
msgstr ""
"GoogleTest/GoogleMock execute the real production algorithm with external "
"pin/clock/lease mocks to verify the nine-cycle bound, SCL stretching, frozen"
" clocks, primary/cleanup separation, retained STOP failures, cleanup-only "
"retries and instance isolation. This proves the software contract, not real "
"open-drain operation or waveforms."

msgid ""
"物理资格要求实际 station 绑定与原始电平采集，测量 SCL 的 low/high、SDA 的 STOP setup、stretching "
"与失败后的引脚/外设所有权。上拉、rise time、多 master 排他、设备 stuck-low 与 SDA "
"释放时机必须用实际装备执行；数值预算由板卡和 器件确定。当前所有相关 physical status 保持 `not_executed`。"
msgstr ""
"Physical qualification requires actual station binding and raw level "
"capture, measuring SCL low/high, SDA STOP setup, stretching and "
"pin/peripheral ownership after failure. Pull-ups, rise time, multi-master "
"exclusion, stuck-low devices and SDA release timing must be tested using "
"real equipment; boards and devices determine numeric budgets. All relevant "
"physical status remains `not_executed`."
